<li data-source-range="1177:1178"><a href="#ch-example-specialty-overview" data-gp-source-token="[Specialty Overview](#ch-example-specialty-overview)" data-gp-source-occurrence="0">Specialty Overview</a> — chapter-02 specialty intro pages with vibe callouts, origin blocks, class tags, definition blocks, and specialty listing cards</li>
<li data-source-range="1178:1179"><a href="#ch-example-specialty-profile" data-gp-source-token="[Specialty Profile](#ch-example-specialty-profile)" data-gp-source-occurrence="0">Specialty Profile</a> — full specialty spread: flavor text, pull quotes, spray banners, sticker chains, skill cards with AP chips and clip-path variants</li>
